!*************************!
!*** THP sub-mechanism ***!
!*************************!
!Based mainly on analogies with: dibutyl-ether (DBE), dipropyl-ether (DPE), diethyl-ether (DEE), tetrahydrofuran (THF) and cyclohexane (CHX)
!Recurrent references:
!DBE_Thion: Thion et al. 2017, Combustion and Flame 185, 4-15
!DPE_Serinyel: Serinyel et al. 2020, Fuel 263, 116554
!DEE_Thion: Thion et al. 2018, Combustion and Flame 193, 453-462
!THF_Fenard: Fenard et al. 2018, Combustion and Flame 191, 252-269  
!CHX_Zou: Zou et al. 2022, Combustion and Flame 235, 111550
!CHX_Serinyel: Serinyel et al. 2013, Combustion and Flame 160, 2319-2332
!
!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
!*** low-temperature ***!
!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
!
!*** first addition of o2 r+o2=ro2 ***!
!
cy(ocjcccc)+o2=jo2cy(cocccc)     1.0E11  0.0  0.0  !Goldsmith (J. PHYS. CHEM. A. 116, 2012, 3325-3346)
