!*** cyclic ether formation ***! 
!
ho2cy(cocjccc)=cy(o)26THP+oh                2.680e+09  0.620 15900 !DBE_Thion: c4oc4-ao2h-1<=>c4oc4oa-1+oh (s./s-ooh)

